{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>And it came to pass, when he saw the nose-ring and the bracelets upon his sister's hands.</b> And he thought it unfitting to be ungrateful." "<b>And when he heard Rebecca's words.</b> That she had asked him <b>Is there room in your father's house for us to lodge?</b>" "<b>And he came to the man.</b> To bring him into his house." "<b>And behold, he stood by the camels.</b> To attend to their needs, not expecting to lodge in Rebecca's father's house until word came from him."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:31:26.203474375Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}